      "writtenOn": "2023-08-09T20:59:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can this depend on `checkCurrentApiTimestamp` instead?  Make-style phony rules like the ones used for `*-check-current-api` are always considered dirty.  That\u0027s probably not a problem here where only the validation rule depends on it, but try to ensure real rules don\u0027t depend on phony rules.",
      "revId": "2a757193d82f3a0df6311eedf7d03989e0dcf119",
