      "writtenOn": "2023-08-15T03:02:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I haven\u0027t followed through how this all works, but are the `java_api_contribution` modules dependencies of this one?  If so, shouldn\u0027t you be able to visit them to get their timestamp files?",
      "parentUuid": "5c70492b_8643d713",
      "revId": "2a757193d82f3a0df6311eedf7d03989e0dcf119",
